    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MATalogics Lead Management API\n\n**Before running:**\n1. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID` in all 6 Google Sheets nodes with your Lead Management sheet ID.\n2. Confirm the tab name is `Sheet1` (or change it).\n3. Select your Google Sheets OAuth2 credential on each Sheets node.\n4. Sheet headers must be exactly:\n   `Name | Email | Phone | Company | Interest | Created At`\n5. **Activate the workflow** to use the production `/webhook/` URLs.\n\n**Endpoints**\n- POST `/create-lead`\n- GET `/get-leads`\n- PUT `/update-lead`\n- DELETE `/delete-lead`\n\nIf delete removes the wrong row, change `row_number - 1` to `row_number` in *Delete Lead Row*.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5d887edb-4255-4256-9ea1-e515048593e3",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
